<!-- Hero -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">Custom Websites</span>
    <h1>Websites That Load Fast, Rank High, and <span class="gradient-text">Actually Convert</span></h1>
    <p>Hand-coded on 11ty. Sub-second load times. Perfect PageSpeed scores. Zero monthly hosting fees. Built from scratch for your business — not from a template.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get a Free Site Audit &#8594;</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Problem Section -->
<section class="problem-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Problem</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">Your Website Is Costing You Customers</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Most small business websites are built on bloated platforms that slow everything down. If your site takes more than 3 seconds to load, 53% of visitors leave before they ever see what you offer.</p>
    <div class="highlight-box fade-in">
      <ul>
        <li>WordPress sites average 3-5 second load times and require constant plugin updates to stay secure</li>
        <li>Wix and Squarespace lock you into their platform and charge $15-50/month forever</li>
        <li>Template-based designs all look the same — your competitors have the same layout you do</li>
        <li>Slow sites get penalized by Google, burying you in search results</li>
        <li>You are paying a developer $100+/hour just to make minor text changes</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Solution Section -->
<section class="solution-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Solution</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">Hand-Coded Static Sites That Outperform Everything</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">We build websites using 11ty, a modern static site generator that produces pure HTML. No database. No server-side processing. No bloat. Just clean code that loads instantly from a global CDN.</p>
    <div class="solution-copy fade-in">
      <p>A static site does not need to query a database or process PHP every time someone visits. The pages are pre-built and served directly from edge servers around the world. The result is a site that loads in under a second, scores 100 on Google PageSpeed, and costs literally nothing to host on platforms like Cloudflare Pages or Netlify.</p>
      <p>Every site we build is custom-designed for your brand, your goals, and your customers. No templates. No page builders. No drag-and-drop limitations. We write the code by hand so every pixel serves a purpose — turning visitors into leads and leads into customers.</p>
      <p>And because our sites are pre-built HTML files, they have zero security vulnerabilities. No WordPress plugins to exploit. No databases to hack. Your site just works, quietly and reliably, 24/7.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

